WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.725 --> 00:00:11.733
Each teaching week has an immersive experience that walks the week's idea as a sequence of scenes, evidence rooms, decisions, and reflection. It reinforces the live class and the readings; it never replaces them.

2
00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:17.916
Pick a week and enter. The experience opens over the page. Nothing behind it is lost.

3
00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:26.072
Move with the on-screen arrows or your keyboard. Each slide is one move: a scene, evidence, a decision, or a diagram.

4
00:00:26.072 --> 00:00:37.074
Use the voice narration if you want it. The accessibility panel can read the current chapter aloud with a voice and speed you choose. It is optional and off by default.

5
00:00:37.074 --> 00:00:47.091
Leave any time. Close returns you to the page you came from. If you come back in the same sitting, you can re-enter and pick up where you left off.

6
00:00:47.091 --> 00:00:51.528
Experiences are teaching, not testing. Nothing is scored.

7
00:00:51.528 --> 00:00:58.512
Where next: After an experience, open the same week's readings or Study Guide to lock the idea in.
